    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like a ghost. like, i walk into the campus cafe or the library and i can see everyone laughing and talking and i know i’m standing right there but it’s like i’m invisible. everyone knows what happened and they just... they just stopped looking at me. it’s so lonely i can’t even breathe properly sometimes. it feels like my life ended but i'm still stuck walking around in the wreckage.",
